    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the Skies. Dominate the Battlefield. Upgrade to Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;<strong>There's Chaos!</strong>&quot;, you take the role of an elite drone pilot, deployed into hostile environments where resources are scarce and competition is fierce. Engage in high-speed aerial combat against rival drones, claim territory, and secure valuable upgrades to push your machine to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced Aerial Combat \u2013 Master precision piloting and outmaneuver your enemies in intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Progression \u2013 Survive each wave to unlock powerful upgrades, customizing your drone to fit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Battlegrounds \u2013 Fight across dynamic environments, each presenting unique challenges and tactical opportunities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to rise above the competition and rule the skies? The battlefield awaits.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the Skies. Dominate the Battlefield. Upgrade to Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;<strong>There's Chaos!</strong>&quot;, you take the role of an elite drone pilot, deployed into hostile environments where resources are scarce and competition is fierce. Engage in high-speed aerial combat against rival drones, claim territory, and secure valuable upgrades to push your machine to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced Aerial Combat \u2013 Master precision piloting and outmaneuver your enemies in intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Progression \u2013 Survive each wave to unlock powerful upgrades, customizing your drone to fit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Battlegrounds \u2013 Fight across dynamic environments, each presenting unique challenges and tactical opportunities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to rise above the competition and rule the skies? The battlefield awaits.</p>",
    "short_description": "An action-packed game with roguelike progression. Pilot a combat drone in intense battles, fighting for resources and territory. Collect and fuse enemy weapons to upgrade your arsenal. Survive chaotic 30-minute runs, earn permanent upgrades, and dominate the battlefield!",
